    <!-- Cloudflare WARP (in-app account registration, the wgcf flow) -->
    <string name="warp_section">Cloudflare WARP (free, generated on this device)</string>
    <string name="warp_note">Registers a WARP account directly from the app — the same two API calls wgcf makes — and stores the profile in app-private storage, so no .conf is ever copied around. Requires no account, no email and no payment. Caveat: Cloudflare refuses WireGuard handshakes in some regions as abuse prevention, and newly provisioned accounts are being issued the MASQUE transport, which WireGuard cannot use. Run "Check WARP status" while connected to find out which you are getting.</string>
